  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Pro-vax (2025), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 1 time.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Pro-vax by Samantha Vanderslott was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2025. It is part of the Medical Humanities: Criticism and Creativity series. Conceptually, the work connects to Computer science.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation. Notable citing venues include PLOS Global Public Health. They come from 4 countries, led by the United Kingdom, Indonesia and Nepal.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 4 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Good health and well-being among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
